OL,3,GNEWSAMan died when he fell in river
OL,4,Aafter team-building day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man died from cold water
OL,7,Fshock after accidentally falling into a
OL,8,Friver following a team-building day
OL,9,Fout, an inquest was told.
OL,11,FSebastian Sailes vanished after he left
OL,12,FThe Black Horse pub in Chippenham,
OL,13,FWiltshire, on 27 February 2025. It was
OL,14,F-5C (23F) that night and the ground was
OL,15,Fslippery near the River Avon where he
OL,16,Fwalked, the inquest was told.
OL,18,FFollowing a huge search mission,
OL,19,Fincluding police divers and volunteers,
OL,20,Fhis body was recovered from the river12
OL,21,Fdays later.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
