OL,3,GNEWSAMan died when he fell in river
OL,4,Aafter team-building day
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Grant Davies ruled that Sailes'
OL,7,Fdeath was a "tragic accident", adding
OL,8,Fthe circumstances of how he entered the
OL,9,Fwater remain unclear.
